"P4007361323" "The Wailer's story"
// DetailString :
"P4482813" "One of the Wailers you defeated told you: <br><br>'Verandi has won. We will give her the information she seeks. Tell her that her first attempt was too simple. To cause enough chaos for us to work our will, she must seek more potent conflicts.'"

